# Foot IK edge cases on slopes: standing, turning on the spot, strafing, walking backwards, sneaking
cheat god
set time 12 0
view clean
foreach slope 10 35 6
  cam auto 220 40
  face across
  walkmode walk
  wait 600
  rec m$I_stand
  wait 1500
  rec m$I_turn
  hold turnl 1500
  wait 1500
  stop
  wait 300
  rec m$I_strafe
  hold left 1500
  wait 1500
  stop
  wait 300
  rec m$I_back
  hold back 1500
  wait 1500
  stop
  walkmode sneak
  face uphill
  wait 300
  rec m$I_sneak
  hold forward 1500
  wait 1500
  stop
end
